{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38338","headline":"和陆拾遗题谏院松 · 吴融","name":"和陆拾遗题谏院松","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"落落孤松何处寻，月华西畔结根深。\n晓含仙掌三清露，晚上宫墙百雉阴。\n野鹤不归应有怨，白云高去太无心。\n碧岩秋涧休相望，捧日元须在禁林。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38338.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38338","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}